  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-250-259">黒き　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-259-280"><rb>素船</rb><rt>すぶね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-280-289">　を　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-289-301"><rb>透</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-301-321">かし見れば、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-321-377">砂　に　しやがめる　影　と　まがひ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-377-427">沖　の　小島　の　薄き　見れば、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-427-474">人　の　思ひに　沈む　けはひ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-474-521">空　に　住へる　月　を　仰ぎ、</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-521-533"><rb>寂</rb><rt>さ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-533-560">びし　わが身　の　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-560-575"><rb>魂</rb><rt>たま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-575-598">　と　見たり。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-598-651">われは　そのまま　まなこ　閉ぢて、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-651-703">消ゆる　世界　を　今ぞ　いだく。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-703-727">浮けよ、沈めよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-727-745"><rb>千々</rb><rt>ちぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-745-765">の　なやみ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-765-777">千々の　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-777-795"><rb>悲</rb><rt>かなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-795-827">み、身をば　乗せて。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-827-857">苦なるいのち　は――</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-857-872"><rb>繁</rb><rt>しげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-872-895">き矢　なり――</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-895-942">積みて　重なる　夢　の　小船。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-942-998">さして　行くへ　を　こゝに　問はじ、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-998-1046">この夜、この時　われは　活きん。</seg></p>
    </body>
